### 🏛️ Executive Summary

ESQET models spacetime as an emergent excitation of a torsionful vacuum manifold whose global boundary conditions are anchored in the golden ratio  
**φ = (1 + √5)/2** and associated topological invariants. The framework recovers Standard Model couplings, gravity, and particle spectrum **without free parameters**.

